<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>PostPilot - Your AI Growth Partner</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff4081, #81d4fa);
      color: #fff;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem;
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 3rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    header p {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .cta-button {
      background-color: #fff;
      color: #ff4081;
      border: none;
      padding: 1rem 2rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      border-radius: 30px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .cta-button:hover {
      background-color: #f8bbd0;
      color: #000;
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 4rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      opacity: 0.8;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header>
    <h1>PostPilot 🚀</h1>
    <p>Your AI-powered growth partner for social media influencers. Personalized strategy, content insights, and brand direction – all in one place.</p>
    <a href="https://tally.so/r/your-form-link" target="_blank">
      <button class="cta-button">Get Your Strategy Now</button>
    </a>
  </header>

  <footer>
    &copy; 2025 PostPilot. All rights reserved.
  </footer>
</body>

</html>
